fixture bell_fifteen_stacks_rings_once
doc The pair of bell_fifteen_stacks_rolls_a_second on seed 2, whose first PROCS draw (850,925 of a million) is over the 50% left after the sure proc: the hit rings once.
seed 2
room test/dummy
option votive_bell_of_the_vigil 15
frames 10
input
  0 attack
end
expect
  at 2 event.hit=1 procs=1 proc.bell_of_the_vigil=1
end
